                        "text": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong></p><ul><li>Orders are dispatched within 1-2 working days</li><li>We deliver pan-India</li><li>Shipping is included in the price: no extra charges at checkout</li><li>Delivery takes 4-5 days after dispatch</li><li>Once the box leaves our facility, we are not responsible for any delivery delays caused by the courier or transport partner</li></ul><p><strong>Returns & claims</strong></p><ul><li>Returns are accepted only for damaged or missing items</li><li>Claims must be raised within 48 hours of delivery</li><li>A video proof of the damage or missing items is mandatory for every claim</li><li>Please shoot an unboxing video: start recording before opening the sealed box, keep the shipping label visible, and record continuously while opening the box and counting the contents</li><li>Claims without video proof cannot be accepted</li><li>No returns for any other reason (change of mind, wrong size or colour ordered, etc.)</li><li>Approved claims are refunded</li></ul><p><strong>How to raise a claim</strong></p><ul><li>WhatsApp us on +91 91111 29997 within 48 hours of delivery</li><li>Share your order number and the unboxing video</li></ul>",
