    "section_yC383k": {
      "type": "section",
      "blocks": {
        "text_Dbygq7": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>",
            "width": "fit-content",
            "max_width": "narrow",
            "alignment": "left",
            "type_preset": "h3",
            "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
            "font_size": "",
            "line_height": "normal",
            "letter_spacing": "normal",
            "case": "none",
            "wrap": "pretty",
            "text_color": "",
            "background": false,
            "background_color": "#00000026",
            "corner_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {}
        },
        "accordion_9RRkxz": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "name": "t:names.accordion",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "caret",
            "dividers": true,
            "divider_color": "",
            "type_preset": "h5",
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": "",
            "border": "none",
            "border_width": 1,
            "border_opacity": 100,
            "border_color": "",
            "border_radius": 0,
            "padding-block-start": 0,
            "padding-block-end": 0,
            "padding-inline-start": 0,
            "padding-inline-end": 0
          },
          "blocks": {
            "accordion_row_bbn9NG": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is the shelf life of straws?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_GNgT9j": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Since these straws are made from biodegradable materials, unlike plastic, these straws do have an expiration time.<br/><br/>They last in your shelves for about <strong>8-12 months</strong> when stored properly packed and away from moisture.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_GNgT9j"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_N9atKV": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Are these edible straws?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_q9rxJC": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>No, these straws are not edible.&nbsp;<br/><br/>You dispose of them like the regular straws, and they <strong>turn into compost</strong> in your city's waste management facilities.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_q9rxJC"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_YQfinh": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "These straws feel like plastic. What material are these made of?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_LhTTm6": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>They do feel like plastic, and that catches most people off guard. <strong>They’re actually made from PLA (polylactic acid), a plant-based material derived from corn starch, not petroleum.</strong> That’s why they stay firm for hours and never turn soggy like paper straws do, while still being 100% compostable and CPCB-certified. So you get the sturdiness of plastic with none of the pollution.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_LhTTm6"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_PyntDd": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What is your MOQ for bulk pricing?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_dTgMNq": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>Our bulk pricing starts from 3,000 pieces.</strong> The exact minimum depends on the size and style of straw you choose. Message us on WhatsApp at +91 91111 29997 with your size, style and quantity, and we’ll send you our bulk rates.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
                  "blocks": {}
                }
              },
              "block_order": [
                "text_dTgMNq"
              ]
            },
            "accordion_row_7YPMeP": {
              "type": "_accordion-row",
              "name": "t:names.accordion_row",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "In how many days will I receive my order?",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              },
              "blocks": {
                "text_3aAGFt": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p><strong>We dispatch orders within 1–2 working days, and delivery usually takes another 4–5 days after that</strong>, so most orders arrive within a week. Once your order is dispatched, we’ll share the tracking details so you can follow it to your door. Delivery times can vary slightly by location and courier.</p>",
                    "width": "100%",
                    "max_width": "normal",
                    "alignment": "left",
                    "type_preset": "rte",
                    "font": "var(--font-body--family)",
                    "font_size": "",
                    "line_height": "normal",
                    "letter_spacing": "normal",
                    "case": "none",
                    "wrap": "pretty",
                    "text_color": "",
                    "background": false,
                    "background_color": "#00000026",
                    "corner_radius": 0,
                    "padding-block-start": 0,
                    "padding-block-end": 0,
                    "padding-inline-start": 0,
                    "padding-inline-end": 0
                  },
